 "pin_regs": {
  "enable": false,
  "reason": "RTL registers the pins: the hub captures cq/client_seq/bank_client/response_seq/pr/enables on plain flops and drives cr/pq from flops; both ring stops capture l_in/pi/eg/ri/tx controls and drive l_out/xq/rce/cco/ack/wko/mirror_busy/fault from flops; the replay client likewise; sid lands on flops. Exceptions (the slice RTL, priced as is): bank_status feeds the status OR / CE adder rung before its first flop, xq_done feeds the commit fault compare. Synthesis pin registers would add an unpriced cycle and break the lockstep with the full slice."
 },
